// handlers.kwxts — GridFrame menu and grid event handlers.
//
// The event-table entries of griddemo.cpp are dispatched here. Handlers whose
// C++ implementation needs an unbound wxGrid API report the gap instead of
// silently doing nothing (the menu item stays, like the artprov sample does for
// wxArtProvider::CreateBitmap).

